# Benchmark run recordings are bulky (~68M of asciinema casts + per-trial logs)
# and fully regenerable. Keep only the structured results the report cites
# (results.json, run_metadata.json) — everything below is reproducible output.
runs/**/sessions/
runs/**/panes/
runs/**/agent-logs/
runs/**/commands.txt
*.cast
run.log

# transient runtime
*.pid
litellm-bridge.log
__pycache__/
tb.lock
